                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Have low expectations for this game\nStart office level\nThere's a group of employees doing exercise in the middle\n1/2 the employees are playing PUBG\nThere's a guy squatting over a toilet in the bathroom\nI explore all rooms, only 1 left looks like managers office and has a bouncer guarding it\nI go inside, music instantly changes to fight music and I'm staring at 3 guys with knives.  They come at me\nThe whole office breaks into a gian fight. \nI grab whatever I can, throw mice, chairs, pens, boxes, find a gun in the storage room.  \nThe shotgun has the weakest bang ever, a kitten's meow is louder.  But it packs a punch\nThis game has Jack Sparrow, Michael from Friday the 13th, Harry Potter, what else can I say?\nBad spelling.\n10/10 would fight by Jack Sparrow's side again.\n\nJust be forewarned, when you die your character falls to the ground, I almost fell over myself.\n\nhttps://www.twitch.tv/videos/205337404",
